serial.help:
usage: vibeos-cli pi5 serial [-h] {up,down,status}

positional arguments:
  {up,down,status}

options:
  -h, --help        show this help message and exit

cargo-swap.help:
usage: vibeos-cli cargo-swap [-h] --arch
                             {i386,i386-uefi,amd64,amd64-uefi,amd64-bios,arm64}
                             [--module {all,ntdll,ntdll_vista,ntoskrnl}]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --arch {i386,i386-uefi,amd64,amd64-uefi,amd64-bios,arm64}
                        target arch (i386/amd64 alias to UEFI; no default)
  --module {all,ntdll,ntdll_vista,ntoskrnl}
                        which cargo-driven module to boot-swap (ntoskrnl is
                        i386-only)

